  "title": "Park Dental Partners Expands Presence in Rochester, MN with Addition of Zumbro View Dental",
  "summary": "MINNEAPOLIS, June 4, 2026 – Park Dental Partners, Inc. (NASDAQ: PARK)(the Company), a leading dental resource organization, announces that effective May 29, 2026, Zumbro View Dental joined the Park Dental Partners network of affiliated dental practices. This is the Company’s fourth general dentistry practice in Rochester, MN. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed. Zumbro Read more...",
